[00:14.77]Where there's a will, there's a way, kind a beautiful
{"有志者事竟成 多么美好"}
[00:18.50]And every night has its day, so magical
{"每个黑夜终将迎来白昼 如此神奇"}
[00:22.26]And if there's love in this life, there's no obstacle
{"若此生有爱 便无坚不摧"}
[00:26.22]That can't be defeated
{"那是无法被击败的"}
[00:29.80]For every tyrant a tear for the vulnerable
{"暴君每滴泪都是弱者的伤悲"}
[00:33.46]In every lost soul the bones of a miracle
{"迷途灵魂中孕育着奇迹光辉"}
[00:37.28]For every dreamer a dream we're unstoppable
{"每个追梦者都势不可挡"}
[00:41.23]With something to believe in
{"因心怀信仰"}
[00:45.41]Monday left me broken
{"周一将我击垮"}
[00:48.20]Tuesday I was through with hoping
{"周二放弃希望"}
[00:51.97]Wednesday my empty arms were open
{"周三张开空荡臂膀"}
[00:55.85]Thursday waiting for love, waiting for love
{"周四等待爱情 等待爱情"}
[01:00.65]Thank the stars it's Friday
{"感谢繁星 周五降临"}
[01:03.23]I'm burning like a fire gone wild on Saturday
{"周六我如野火焚身"}
[01:06.99]Guess I won't be coming to church on Sunday
{"周日想必不会去教堂礼拜"}
[01:10.69]I'll be waiting for love, waiting for love
{"我会等待爱情 等待爱情"}
[01:15.42]To come around
{"直到它降临"}
[02:07.38]We are one of a kind irreplaceable
{"我们独一无二 无可替代"}
[02:11.21]How did I get so blind and so cynical
{"为何变得如此盲目愤世"}
[02:14.90]If there's love in this life we're unstoppable
{"若此生有爱 便所向披靡"}
[02:18.71]No we can't be defeated
{"我们永不言败"}
