{"周一将我击垮"}
[02:25.68]Tuesday I was through with hoping
{"周二放弃希望"}
[02:29.33]Wednesday my empty arms were open
{"周三张开空荡臂膀"}
[02:33.18]Thursday waiting for love, waiting for love
{"周四等待爱情 等待爱情"}
[02:37.91]Thank the stars it's Friday
{"感谢星辰 终于迎来周五"}
[02:40.60]I'm burning like a fire gone wild on Saturday
{"周六的我如失控野火般燃烧"}
[02:44.47]Guess I won't be coming to church on Sunday
{"周日教堂的礼拜我恐怕要缺席"}
[02:48.16]I'll be waiting for love, waiting for love
{"我会等待爱情 等待爱情"}
[02:52.78]To come around
{"降临身边"}
